flowchart LR
    Main[main thread<br/>CLI, start, join, summary]

    subgraph Philosophers
        P0[Philosopher 0<br/>TID]
        P1[Philosopher 1<br/>TID]
        PN[Philosopher N-1<br/>TID]
    end

    CS[Critical section<br/>std::mutex]
    Queue[(Central request queue)]
    Forks[(fork_owner N<br/>-1 = free)]
    Stats[(Statistics)]
    Log[(Thread-safe event log)]

    Main --> P0
    Main --> P1
    Main --> PN

    P0 --> CS
    P1 --> CS
    PN --> CS

    CS --> Queue
    CS --> Forks
    CS --> Stats
    P0 --> Log
    P1 --> Log
    PN --> Log

    Event[Auto-reset event<br/>per request]
    CS --> Event
    Event --> P0
    Event --> P1
    Event --> PN
